# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF（含 UTF-8 BOM）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不要做任何转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# 语言统计：把文档和生成物排除，让 GitHub 的语言条反映真实代码
docs/** linguist-documentation
promo/** linguist-documentation
perf/** linguist-documentation
